{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金萬\nカスタードリーフのシュークリーム\n諸越"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カスタードリーフのシュークリームは\n絢音ちゃんのご家族から！\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリームたっぷりすぎて\nさらに生地が薄くて柔らかくて\n溢れちゃうんじゃないかって思うくらいで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中のクリームばっかり食べても\n最後までクリームが無くならない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田でしか食べれないのかな？(*_*)\n秋田また来なきゃ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで昨日は\nアンダーライブ全国ツアー\n秋田公演でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんはリハ中に怪我をしちゃって\nアンコールからの出演となりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんが抜けたところ\nいろいろ立ち位置変わったんだぞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね、今日の飯ぺろの諸越\n実は怪我する前のまいちゅんにもらったの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから許すね( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モノにつられる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nまあやのお誕生日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでサプライズお祝いしました！\n18歳おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、なんと言っても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃんの凱旋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃんの言葉ひとつひとつに\n心を揺さぶられた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は盛りだくさんだし\n本当に暑かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗だくでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでまいちゅんの分も頑張ろうと\n余計集中してたからってのもある気がする"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当はみんなで立ちたかったけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く治りますように！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は千秋楽"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『SamuraiELO』発売中です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃん、ちーちゃん、伊織、ちま、中田\nで撮影してきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い服来て\n楽しく撮影してきたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/04/24/5715646/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}